  "name": "Clear Mind (Ex)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, a cleric can regain his MP quicker. The cleric must be relaxed and free from overt distractions, such as combat raging nearby or other loud noises, and does not gain this recovery if asleep or unconscious. The cleric regains 1 MP per hour. This increases by 1 for every five cleric levels after 5th (Clear Mind I at 5th, Clear Mind II at 10th, Clear Mind III at 15th, Clear Mind IV at 20th).</p>",
